  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Vocational Training and Self-Sufficiency Assistance Project for Vulnerable Women in the Mirpur Slum Area of Bangladesh</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Bangladesh is located in the northeastern part of the South Asian continent, and its per capita GDP is $2,140. The 8th 5-year National Development Plan aims to strengthen various fields such as education, health, vocational training, agriculture, and water resources, with the vision of creating an inclusive and prosperous Bangladesh.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Contribution to increasing income through employment for vulnerable women (aged 18-35) in the Mirpur area of Bangladesh, aligned with SDG 4.3.&#xbc00;&#xd480; &#xc9c0;&#xc5ed; &#xcde8;&#xc57d;&#xacc4;&#xce35; &#xc5ec;&#xc131;&#xc758; &#xcde8;&#xc5c5; &#xae30;&#xd68c; &#xd655;&#xb300;, &#xbc00;&#xd480; &#xc9c0;&#xc5ed; &#xcde8;&#xc57d;&#xacc4;&#xce35; &#xc5ec;&#xc131;&#xc758; &#xcde8;&#xc5c5; &#xd5a5;&#xc0c1;</narrative>
